        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1592237892617-4320f8042f03?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3ODczODQ3NDd8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post TypeScript" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;microsofttypescript&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;microsoft/TypeScript&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;typescript&#34;&gt;TypeScript
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/actions/workflows/ci.yml&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;CI&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://badge.fury.io/js/typescript.svg&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;npm version&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/typescript.svg&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Downloads&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://securityscorecards.dev/viewer/?uri=github.com/microsoft/TypeScript&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://api.securityscorecards.dev/projects/github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/badge&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;OpenSSF Scorecard&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.typescriptlang.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;TypeScript&lt;/a&gt; is a language for application-scale JavaScript. TypeScript adds optional types to JavaScript that support tools for large-scale JavaScript applications for any browser, for any host, on any OS. TypeScript compiles to readable, standards-based JavaScript. Try it out at the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.typescriptlang.org/play/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;playground&lt;/a&gt;, and stay up to date via &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://blogs.msdn.microsoft.com/typescript&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;our blog&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://twitter.com/typescript&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Twitter account&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find others who are using TypeScript at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.typescriptlang.org/community/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;our community page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;installing&#34;&gt;Installing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For the latest stable version:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;npm install -D typescript
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;For our nightly builds:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;npm install -D typescript@next
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;contribute&#34;&gt;Contribute
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;There are many ways to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;contribute&lt;/a&gt; to TypeScript.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Submit bugs&lt;/a&gt; and help us verify fixes as they are checked in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/pulls&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;source code changes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with other TypeScript users and developers on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/typescript&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;StackOverflow&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help each other in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/typescript&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;TypeScript Community Discord&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://twitter.com/search?q=%23TypeScript&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;#typescript&lt;/a&gt; discussion on Twitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Contribute bug fixes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This project has adopted the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://opensource.microsoft.com/codeofconduct/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Microsoft Open Source Code of Conduct&lt;/a&gt;. For more information see
the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://opensource.microsoft.com/codeofconduct/faq/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Code of Conduct FAQ&lt;/a&gt; or contact &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;mailto:opencode@microsoft.com&#34; &gt;opencode@microsoft.com&lt;/a&gt;
with any additional questions or comments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;documentation&#34;&gt;Documentation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/typescript-in-5-minutes.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;TypeScript in 5 minutes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/intro.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Programming handbook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.typescriptlang.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Homepage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;roadmap&#34;&gt;Roadmap
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For details on our planned features and future direction, please refer to our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/wiki/Roadmap&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;roadmap&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
